<title>AUSTRALIA: Gencor eyes QNI takeover-brokers.</title>
<headline>Gencor eyes QNI takeover-brokers.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Speculation was rife in the Australian stock market on Tuesday that South African mining house Gencor Ltd was poised to make a takeover offer for QNI Ltd, Australia's second largest nickel producer, stockbrokers and analysts said.</p>
<p>QNI shares were suspended from trading at the Australian Stock Exchange on Tuesday at the company's request pending the release of an announcement after a board meeting June 18.</p>
</text>
